    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: May 7, 2026</p>

    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>When you use Bookwize, we collect information you provide directly: your name, email, phone number, business details, and booking data. We also collect usage data such as pages visited and features used.</p>

    <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To provide and maintain the Bookwize service</li>
      <li>To send booking confirmations, reminders, and notifications</li>
      <li>To process payments via Stripe</li>
      <li>To improve our service and user experience</li>
      <li>To communicate updates about your account</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Data Sharing</h2>
    <p>We do not sell your personal data. We share data only with: Stripe (payment processing), Gmail SMTP (email delivery), and hosting providers necessary to operate the service.</p>

    <h2>4. Data Security</h2>
    <p>We use industry-standard encryption (HTTPS/TLS), hashed passwords (bcrypt), and secure session management to protect your data.</p>

    <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
    <p>You can access, update, or delete your personal data at any time through your admin dashboard. To request full data deletion, contact us at bookwizeapp on Instagram.</p>

    <h2>6. Cookies</h2>
    <p>We use session cookies to keep you logged in. We do not use tracking or advertising cookies.</p>

    <h2>7. Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy questions, contact us via <a href="https://www.instagram.com/bookwizeapp" style="color:#F28C38">Instagram @bookwizeapp</a>.</p>
  </div>
